From 2544adc4a279535296cb56d59ec355da407ddc1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:49:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] MOVE-17: regime switch from the style lab (duel only, switch
 off)

On each new enemy shot the surf flips, with probability 0.4 from a
replaying die, between its free regime and a steady one that reverses
only when reversing is 30% safer than keeping on. MoveDesign.REGIME is
false, so the off path is unchanged (replay fixtures untouched; only the
duel pins are re-written). Ablation: regime (suffix rg).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EegM1B4Sn9cDNUrYMC6ktf
